Package: sqc
Title: Companion Tools for a Statistical Quality Control Course
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Tyler", "Grimes", email = "tyler.grimes.unf@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Control chart constants (d2, d3, c4, A2, D3, D4, and others),
    Shewhart X-bar and R charts and Levey-Jennings charts with the Westgard
    rules drawn with ggplot2, a run-length simulator for the average run
    length of control rules, single sampling plans for acceptance sampling
    (OC curves, producer's and consumer's risk, average outgoing quality,
    and a plan search), and the example datasets used in the lecture slides
    and notes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tgrimes/sqc
BugReports: https://github.com/tgrimes/sqc/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    rlang,
    tibble
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
LazyData: true
